 "content": "<div class=\"ship-header\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">— VERSANDINFO</div>\n<h1>Versand &amp; Zahlung</h1>\n<p class=\"ship-sub\">Alle Informationen zu Versandablauf, Verpackung und Lieferzeiten.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-wrap\">\n<div class=\"ship-card ship-card-wide\">\n<h3>Versandablauf</h3>\n<div class=\"ship-steps\">\n<div class=\"ship-step\">\n<div class=\"ship-step-n\">1</div>\n<p>Bestellung aufgeben &amp; Zahlung per Überweisung , Bestätigungserhalt per E-Mail <strong>(SPAM-ORDNER)</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-step\">\n<div class=\"ship-step-n\">2</div>\n<p>Nach Zahlungseingang: Bestellung wird bearbeitet</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-step\">\n<div class=\"ship-step-n\">3</div>\n<p>Versandbestätigung mit Tracking per E-Mail <strong>(SPAM-ORDNER)</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-step\">\n<div class=\"ship-step-n\">4</div>\n<p>Bestellungen bis 14:00 Uhr → Versand noch am selben Werktag</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-step\">\n<div class=\"ship-step-n\">5</div>\n<p>Lieferung schätzungsweise innerhalb von 2–4 Werktagen</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-card\">\n<div class=\"ship-icon\"></div>\n<h3>Versandkosten</h3>\n<ul class=\"ship-list\">\n<li>Standardversand<strong>6,90 €</strong></li>\n<li>Kostenloser Versand<strong>ab 99 €</strong></li>\n<li>Versandgebiet <strong>Nur Deutschland</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-card\">\n<div class=\"ship-icon\"></div>\n<h3>Lieferzeit</h3>\n<ul class=\"ship-list\">\n<li>Werktags bis 14:00 Uhr <strong>Versand am selben Tag</strong></li>\n<li>Danach / Wochenende <strong>Nächster Werktag</strong></li>\n<li>Lieferzeit <strong>2–4 Werktage</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ship-card ship-card-wide ship-contact\">\n<div class=\"ship-icon\"></div>\n<h3>Fragen zum Versand?</h3>\n<p>Bei Fragen erreichst du uns unter:</p>\n<p><a class=\"ship-mail\" href=\"mailto:support@aminolabspro.com\">support@aminolabspro.com</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.ship-header { padding: 48px 24px 12px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #E4EBF0; margin-bottom: 40px; } .ship-header .eyebrow { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6EDAB4; margin-bottom: 14px; } .ship-header h1 { font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 38px); font-weight: 700; color: #1A1F2E; margin-bottom: 12px; } .ship-sub { font-size: 15px; color: #5A6478; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 24px; line-height: 1.6; } .ship-wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 60px; padding: 0 24px; } .ship-card-wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; } .ship-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 0%, rgba(240,251,247,0.5) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(26,31,46,0.07), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.7); } .ship-icon { width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.95), rgba(212,243,232,0.5)); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(110,218,180,0.18), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.9); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #4DC49A; margin-bottom: 16px; } .ship-card h3 { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A1F2E; margin-bottom: 16px; } .ship-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; } .ship-step { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; } .ship-step-n { flex-shrink: 0; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.95), rgba(212,243,232,0.5)); border: 1.5px solid rgba(110,218,180,0.4); box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(110,218,180,0.2); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #4DC49A; } .ship-step p { font-size: 14px; color: #5A6478; line-height: 1.6; padding-top: 4px; } .ship-list